meta {
  name: Create Coupon
  type: http
  seq: 13
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/coupons/
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

body:json {
  {
    "code": "EXAMPLE10",
    "discount_type": "percent",
    "value": 10.0
  }
}

docs {
**Access:** Admin (bearer)

**Request body** `CouponCreate`:
  - `code`: string (required)
  - `description`: string|null
  - `discount_type`: string (required) — one of ['percent', 'fixed']
  - `value`: number (required)
  - `currency`: string|null
  - `min_order_amount`: number|null
  - `max_uses`: integer|null
  - `per_user_limit`: integer|null
  - `starts_at`: string|null
  - `ends_at`: string|null
  - `is_active`: boolean

**Responses:** 201, 422
}
